532.0, -1549.0, -1557.0, -1572.0, -1581.0, -1592.0, -1592.0, -1599.0, -1604.0, -1608.0, -1621.0, -1632.0, -1632.0, -1645.0, -1661.0, -1661.0, -1701.0, -1738.0, -1770.0, -1858.0, -1934.0, -2051.0, -2117.0, -2269.0, -2269.0, -2421.0, -2517.0, -2517.0, -2569.0, -2595.0, -2607.0, -2610.0, -2610.0, -2611.0, -2614.0, -2618.0, -2625.0, -2639.0, -2639.0, -2651.0, -2657.0, -2671.0, -2669.0, -2656.0, -2645.0, -2577.0, -2532.0, -2469.0, -2315.0, -2187.0, -1983.0, -1677.0, -1677.0, -1354.0, -1354.0, -1276.0, -944.0, -944.0, -654.0, -405.0], "splits": [106, 257], "rotation": 335.0, "source": "fastest lap"}, "rain_mm": [["2026-10-11T12:00:00", 0.0], ["2026-10-11T13:00:00", 0.0], ["2026-10-11T14:00:00", 0.0], ["2026-10-11T15:00:00", 0.0], ["2026-10-11T16:00:00", 0.0], ["2026-10-11T17:00:00", 0.0]], "transcripts": {"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/LIN_41_20261011_201511.mp3": {"text": "That is quite the end of what science did. Final break, all three crash.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "这就是科学的终结。最后休息，所有三个坠机。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20261011_202213.mp3": {"text": "Five, eight, nine, speed, and opposite turn, red door.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "五，八，九，速度，和对面转弯，红门。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_202337.mp3": {"text": "Lando, do you remember the discussion we had in the strategy meeting? Do you still agree that your idea would be best? Yeah, I think so. I understand.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20261011_202550.mp3": {"text": "If we could continue to eke this out, Max, it will only help our course.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "如果我们能继续说出去，麦克斯，那只会对我们的航线有所帮助。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261011_203104.mp3": {"text": "For Plan C, we need to pick up the... It's coming off. I don't have a paper face. Copy, then we move to Plan B.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "对于C计划，我们需要拿起。..渐渐解脱。我没有纸脸。收到，然后我们转到B计划。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_203149.mp3": {"text": "You think you can undercut the cars ahead. Yeah, I mean the pace is a lot better. My pace feels strong on us.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_203453.mp3": {"text": "This is a track living skimping turn one, keeping eye on this. We've got quite a lot to turn one from here. Keep an eye on this.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "这是一条活在滑行1号弯的赛道，注意这个。我们有很多1号弯从这里。留心这个"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20261011_203719.mp3": {"text": "Try a phase update when you can, please. As I said, I cannot go for the cargo.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "请在可以的时候尝试一个阶段更新。我说过，我不能去买货。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HUL_27_20261011_203959.mp3": {"text": "And on some switch, check the switches, and I'm prying here, something like I'm hanging around. I know, Nico, you're doing well. Keep it up.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "在一个开关上，检查开关，我在这里打探，一些我挂在身边的东西。我知道，尼科，你表现得很好继续说"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_204351.mp3": {"text": "Degradation looks low, we're happy for you to lean on this time, see what we do.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "轮胎衰退看起来很低，我们很高兴你这次能靠拢，看看我们做什么。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261011_204708.mp3": {"text": "For those two seconds, let us out. Copy. Are we short?", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261011_205009.mp3": {"text": "I need to use the speed link. We need more management in 2018 for tyres and performance.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20261011_211057.mp3": {"text": "Sorry, I missed you.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "对不起，我想念你。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_211206.mp3": {"text": "Mate, there's no brake. I just went brake. OK, stand by, we'll have a look. Better work so long.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261011_211400.mp3": {"text": "So this time, I don't know what, check my tyres, now stop, stop, stop. Understood, we are checking, car looks fine.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_211501.mp3": {"text": "", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_211503.mp3": {"text": "Kimi, that looks like the heat soak inside the pedal scuff back. Is that a reminder of track limits? Let's keep it lit clean.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20261011_211610.mp3": {"text": "We are on Plan B, we are getting close. Can I not just hold it up? Back to you. And we are six laps short to do Plan C.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20261011_212832.mp3": {"text": "Max, under a safety car, we would lose position 2, Leclaire, but I'm worried about restarting on this tyre, sir. Not really, I can't. If you would accept pitting behind Leclaire, save nothing. If you don't want to pit key up on the radio, try to say something. OK, mate, understood. Thank you.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "Max，在安全车下，我们会失去2号位置， Leclaire，但我担心在轮胎上重启，先生。没有，我不能。如果你愿意站在莱克莱尔身后什么都不要如果你不想用进站在无线电上按键试着说点什么好吧，伙计，明白了。谢谢。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_213724.mp3": {"text": "Is there any way to help out behind or not? I'm not going to catch the guys in here now. I'll get back to you.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_213753.mp3": {"text": "", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20261011_213802.mp3": {"text": "Track limits, track limits, track limits. Did you get one? Not now, but you're pushing it.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_214200.mp3": {"text": "Lando, we have a developing potential sensor issue, so just be careful under-breaking. That team got behind us to Oscar.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20261011_214304.mp3": {"text": "Lights right now, Pascarralda, keep going.", "model": "small.en"}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20261011_214630.mp3": {"text": "Yes, Max. Did a very long time at the bank with that one. Pleased to see you've got it. Well done. Well done, Max. It's the same we can't hear you, but everyone is screaming at you to say, well, don't you? You've completely dominated that one.", "model": "small.en", "zh": {"offline": "是的，马克思。和那个一起在银行呆了很久喜见已得。干得不错。干得好，马克思。我们听不到你的声音但大家都在对你大喊大叫，不是吗？你完全支配了那个。"}}, "https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-10-11_Singapore_Grand_Prix/2026-10-11_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20261011_214747.mp3": {"text": "Well done, Charles. Nicely driven race. It was a good race, but it was just not that simple. I think good job for, for the strategy. No good call. I guess you try something different.", "model": "small.en"}}}